<p>A sales funnel for your small business is not some complex marketing theory reserved for corporations with dedicated teams. It is a practical system that captures interest, builds trust, and makes it easy for people to buy from you. Four stages. A handful of automated messages. A clear path from stranger to customer.</p>

<p>Build it once. Refine it as you learn. Let the system handle the repetition so you can focus on delivering great work for the customers who come through the other side.</p>

